OL,3,GNEWSACommunities 'hollowed out' by
OL,4,Asocial housing sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities are being hollowed out as
OL,7,Faffordable and social housing in rural
OL,8,Fand coastal villages and towns are sold
OL,9,Foff, it is claimed.
OL,11,FA councillor has claimed social housing
OL,12,Fis being sold off in parts of the South
OL,13,FHams, Devon, and replaced with
OL,14,Fnew-build homes on the edge of the city
OL,15,Fof Plymouth.
OL,17,FA mother-to-be said she and her partner
OL,18,Fwere forced to rent privately in order
OL,19,Fto stay in the rural village where she
OL,20,Fgrew up because all the affordable
OL,21,Fhomes for rent had been sold off.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
